msgid "Immich is a self-hosted photo and video backup solution. The stack is created in the Compose plugin (Services -> Compose -> Files) where it can also be inspected or edited; configure the Compose plugin shared folder first. Save the settings, click Apply, then use the buttons below to deploy and manage the stack. While the stack is running it starts automatically at boot."
