msgstr ""

msgid "Photo library shared folder"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shared folder where photos and videos are stored (container path /data). To move the photo library or the database folder, select the new folder in the form but do NOT save yet - click 'Test directories' to validate the changed folders and 'Migrate data' to copy them. Save only after the migration succeeded; the data in the old folders is removed when the settings are saved."
msgstr ""

