msgid "Directory migration"
msgstr ""

msgid "Do you really want to migrate the data of the changed folders? The service is stopped, the data is copied with rsync (the originals stay untouched) and the stack is started temporarily on the new locations so that you can verify it. Nothing is saved until you click Save; the data in the old folders is removed when the settings are saved."
msgstr ""

